  "translation": "A fɔ ko: Fɔɔ taa, k'a jonge kulu kan, Yawe ɲɛfɛ. N'ayira, Yawe bɛ taabolo-fɔli kɛ, fiɲɛ bon ni ka se baarakɛ bɛ kulubaw lasigini ani kɛnɛkabakurunw fresili Yawe ɲɛfɛ; Yawe tɛ fiɲɛ kɔnɔ. Fiɲɛ kɔfɛ, dugukolosɛgɛsɛgɛli — Yawe tɛ dugukolosɛgɛsɛgɛli kɔnɔ.",
